+# The scroll bar rules of the widget. The thumb and the groove of the bar read
+# the slider keys and the groove keys of the settings, and no table above binds
+# a rule of them to those keys. The check below runs the writer over each key,
+# and it reads the four rules of each arm.
+add_custom_command(TARGET qtcurve-gtk-theme POST_BUILD
